## 8. Edge Cases & Considerations

- If the intent parser returns an invalid or ambiguous plan, fallback to a default AI response
- All tool calls are strictly validated for input/output types
- Tool execution is logged for debugging and analytics
- The system is designed for plugin-first extensibility (universe-specific tools via plugins)
- If a response is deemed poor during pre-response evaluation, retry with a different model/server pair before delivering it to the user

